<title>RUSSIA: Russia Nov crude oil output down three pct on Oct.</title>
<headline>Russia Nov crude oil output down three pct on Oct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian crude oil output in November fell three percent on October and 0.6 percent on a year ago, State Statistics Committee figures released on Sunday showed.</p>
<p>The committee released the following data for energy production:</p>
<p>			Jan-Nov 1996 output	 Nov 1996 output</p>
<p>		   in million     yr/yr	percentage change on:</p>
<p>		     tonnes   percent change    Oct 1996  Nov 1995</p>
<p> Crude oil	  268	    -2		  -3	 -0.6</p>
<p> Refined oil	161	    -4		  -5	 -2</p>
<p> Gasoline	    24.4	  -6		  -5	 -8</p>
<p> Diesel		42.9	  -2		  -7	 +3</p>
<p> Heavy fuel oil    58.4	  -2		  -1	 +9</p>
<p>(mazut)</p>
<p> Lubricants	   2.1	  -9		  -9	-20</p>
<p> Natural gas	522	    +1	    +0.3	 -0.6</p>
<p>(billion cubic</p>
<p>metres)</p>
<p> Gas condensate     7.5	  -0.8		+7	 -0.3</p>
<p>-- Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
